script = ExtResource("1")

; Brigantine — ported verbatim from FATHOM.EXE main:models3d.js (the
; `brigantine` entry). 24 vertices. Robust hull, two equal-height masts:
; foremast carries a square sail, mainmast carries a triangular gaff sail.
;
; AXIS CONVERSION: JS (+Z forward, left-handed) → Godot (-Z forward,
; right-handed). Every JS vertex (x, y, z) becomes (x, y, -z). JS `mastZ`
; in sailDeformations is likewise negated.

